        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BLD125HMRSALRS, Hammered Boulder Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hammered Square Boulder Door Pull with Square Rosettes has a unique look that straddles rustic and modern in a way that complements both decor styles. This hammered door pull is crafted by hand. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths; each of them made from 1-1/4 inch square aluminum bar. The Hammered Boulder Door Handle is available in some beautiful finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Boulder Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware and 2 square rosettes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BLD125018HMRSALRS:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BLD125024HMRSALRS:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BLD125036HMRSALRS:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
